{"id":"n49437-2-8","stage":1,"title":"답답하다 · 着急","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49437-2-8-1","ko":"오늘 네 덕분에 마음이 좀 가벼워졌어.","zh":"今天多亏了你，我的心情轻松了不少。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음이","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가벼워졌어.","meaning":"轻快，轻松；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"가볍다：轻快，轻松；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가볍다","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26788","senseId":"15","lemma":"가볍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情，心绪","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"情绪或感受。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"77632f6eee12aa1b","term":"가볍다","zh":"轻快，轻松","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3","entryId":"26788","definition":"心情放松愉快。","pronunciation":["가볍따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d96406a1e267f4d5d21.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49437-2-8-2","ko":"그래. 답답할 때는 언제든지 찾아와.","zh":"是啊。什么时候觉得烦闷，随时都可以来找我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"답답할","meaning":"着急，心焦","explanation":"답답하다：着急，心焦；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"답답하다","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49437","senseId":"2","lemma":"답답하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때는","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제든지","meaning":"随时","explanation":"언제：随时；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；든지：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"3","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아와.","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"303de431f55bd88a","term":"답답하다","zh":"着急，心焦","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3","entryId":"49437","definition":"因忧虑或担心而心里焦躁不安。","pronunciation":["답따파다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"随时","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"指代不确定的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cb85e1fc5e4c8840b824.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49437","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5601,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊。什么时候觉得烦闷，随时都可以来找我。","今天多亏了你，我的心情轻松了不少。","最近都在做些什么呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天多亏了你，我的心情轻松了不少。","最近都在做些什么呢？","是啊。什么时候觉得烦闷，随时都可以来找我。"],"answer":2}]}
